Third-party material
--------------------

This repository contains material taken or adapted from the projects below. Each affected
module says so in its header comment or in the docstring of the copied definition.

- Mathlib (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4), Apache License 2.0.
  MathProof/Challenges/C0023IMO1988Q6PerfectSquare.lean is a port of Mathlib's
  Archive/Imo/Imo1988Q6.lean: both theorems and their proofs are unchanged.
  Copyright (c) 2019 Johan Commelin. Author: Johan Commelin.
  The file carries the original notice and a list of the changes made.

- Formal Conjectures (https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures),
  Apache License 2.0. Copyright 2025 The Formal Conjectures Authors.
  Theorem statements for several Erdős-problem challenges are taken from it, and
  C0041 and C0047 replicate its definitions verbatim (marked "Replicated verbatim" in
  the source). The witness in C0047 is Danzer's construction, taken from the same project.

- PutnamBench (https://github.com/trishullab/PutnamBench), whose Lean 4 formalizations
  are released under the Apache License 2.0. Authors, as listed by that project:
  George Tsoukalas, Jasper Lee, John Jennings, Jimmy Xin, Michelle Ding, Michael Jennings,
  Amitayush Thakur, Swarat Chaudhuri.
  Theorem statements for the Putnam challenges are taken from it.

This repository uses Mathlib as a library. It is fetched at build time and is not redistributed
here, apart from the one ported file named above.
